# Keep line endings LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. Git is configured with core.autocrlf=true on at least one
# machine here, which rewrites files to CRLF on checkout, while Prettier writes
# and checks LF. Without this, `pnpm format:check` fails on a fresh clone for
# every file in the repo, and the pre-commit hook reformats files nobody touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
